Validation checks

- broken-links: broken internal note, heading, and block targets
  Category: links
  Suites: default, all
  Applicability: always
  Required projections: validation
  Supported surfaces: local, ci, agent
  Prerequisite mode: auto_managed
  Missing prerequisite: blocked
  Remediation: plan (rzm validate fix broken-links)

- code-anchors: code anchor matches
  Category: code
  Suites: all
  Applicability: code_anchor_roots_configured
  Required projections: validation, code
  Supported surfaces: local, agent
  Prerequisite mode: external_persisted
  Missing prerequisite: blocked
  Preparation: rzm index
  Remediation: plan (rzm validate fix code-anchors)
